@startuml
title UML State Transition Diagram - Video Suggestion System

[*] --> ReceiveRequest

state "Receive video suggestion request" as ReceiveRequest
ReceiveRequest : entry / A new suggestion request is received
ReceiveRequest : do / Process the incoming request

ReceiveRequest --> IdentifyUser

state "Identify user" as IdentifyUser
IdentifyUser : entry / User makes a request
IdentifyUser : do / Verify and identify the user

IdentifyUser --> GatherVideos

state "Gather suggested videos" as GatherVideos
GatherVideos : entry / User identified successfully
GatherVideos : do / Collect videos based on preferences, trends, tags, genres, and promotions

GatherVideos --> AddDetails

state "Add additional details" as AddDetails
AddDetails : entry / Videos gathered
AddDetails : do / Enrich with thumbnails and view counts

AddDetails --> SendSuggestions

state "Send suggested videos" as SendSuggestions
SendSuggestions : entry / Details added
SendSuggestions : do / Deliver suggestions to the user

SendSuggestions --> [*]

@enduml
